#. module: td_mebli_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:td_mebli_sale.field_sale_order__td_delay_reason
msgid ""
"Read only (AC-066): «Customer» when the last fixed change of the order was "
"asked by the customer, «Cutting at the Distributor» when the parts cut by "
"the distributor come back last, «Supplier» when a purchased item arrives too"
" late for the promised date, «Company» when the workshop is late."
msgstr ""

#. module: td_mebli_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:td_mebli_sale.field_purchase_order_line__td_date_ready
msgid ""
"Read only. The expected delivery date of the line (Purchase), plus the "
"average delay of this supplier in the history of receipts, plus the "
"manufacturing lead time of the bill of materials that consumes it: when the "
"sales order can be ready if only this item is waited for. Empty when the "
"item is received or the purchase is cancelled."
msgstr ""

#. module: td_mebli_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:td_mebli_sale.field_res_partner__td_supplier_delay_avg
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:td_mebli_sale.field_res_users__td_supplier_delay_avg
msgid ""
"Read only: received purchase lines of the past year, the receipt date "
"against the expected arrival; early deliveries count as on time. Added to "
"the supplier date in the forecast date of the order."
msgstr ""

#. module: td_mebli_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:td_mebli_sale.field_purchase_order_line__td_supplier_delay
msgid ""
"Read only: the average delay of the supplier over the past year (received "
"purchase lines: the receipt date against the expected arrival), rounded to "
"days; early deliveries count as on time."
msgstr ""

#. module: td_mebli_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:td_mebli_sale.field_purchase_order_line__td_late_days
msgid ""
"Read only: the expected arrival (supplier date + the average delay of the "
"supplier) minus the date the item is needed."
msgstr ""

#. module: td_mebli_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:td_mebli_sale.view_order_form_td_mebli_dates
msgid ""
"Read only: the supplier date is kept in the purchase order. The forecast date\n"
"                        of the order is the later of the two: the workshop is ready ("
msgstr ""

#. module: td_mebli_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:td_mebli_sale.field_purchase_order_line__td_need_date
msgid ""
"Read only: when the manufacturing order that consumes the item plans to "
"start (the date of its component move), else the promised date of the sales "
"order."
msgstr ""

